sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant Comp as compression()
  participant R as Express Router
  participant H as Route Handler
  C->>Comp: HTTP GET /api/tasks (Accept-Encoding: gzip)
  Comp->>R: 透传（无 body 时不压缩）
  R->>H: 路由匹配
  H-->>Comp: res.json({...}) 生成 body
  Comp-->>C: gzip 编码响应 (Content-Encoding: gzip)
  Note over Comp: app.use(compression()) 位于 index.js:53，<br/>早于所有 app.use('/api', ...)（index.js:59+）

---

sequenceDiagram
  participant FE as Frontend (全量)
  participant Svc as services/index.js
  participant RT as Route (tasks.js)
  participant PG as utils/pagination.js
  participant MG as Mongoose
  FE->>Svc: taskService.getAll()  // 本次不传 page/limit
  Svc->>RT: GET /api/tasks
  RT->>PG: parsePaging(req.query)  // usePaging=false
  RT->>MG: Task.countDocuments(query)
  RT->>MG: Task.find(query).lean().populate(...).sort(...)
  MG-->>RT: 全量 tasks[]
  RT->>PG: pagingEnvelope('tasks', tasks, {usePaging:false,total})
  RT-->>Svc: {success,count,total,tasks}  // 无 page/pageSize
  Svc->>Svc: normalize() → {data:{data: tasks[]}}
  Svc-->>FE: setTasks(data.data)
  Note over FE: 未来若传 page/limit → usePaging=true → 回显 page/pageSize

---

sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Companies 页面
  participant VL as VirtualList (react-window)
  participant RC as CompanyCard (memo)
  P->>P: fetchAll → setCompanies(全量 N 条)
  P->>VL: <VirtualList items={companies} rowComponent={CompanyCard}/>
  VL->>VL: 仅按可视区高度计算 startIndex/endIndex
  loop 仅可视区 items
    VL->>RC: renderRow({company, onEdit, onDelete})
    RC-->>VL: 卡片 DOM
  end
  Note over P,RC: 父 state 抖动（搜索框 onChange）→ RC 已 memo，<br/>未变化的卡片因 props 引用稳定而跳过重渲染

---

sequenceDiagram
  participant Shell as AdminPanel (Shell)
  participant Tab as RulesLibraryTab
  participant Hook as useRulesLibrary
  participant API as scheduleService
  Shell->>Shell: 持 tab 选中态（useState）
  Shell->>Tab: <RulesLibraryTab/>  （仅布局+选中态下传）
  Tab->>Hook: useRulesLibrary()
  Hook->>API: scheduleService.getRules()
  API-->>Hook: rules[]
  Hook-->>Tab: {rules, loading, save, import}
  Tab-->>Shell: 自管内部 state/派生，父不持数据
  Note over Shell,Tab: 等价重构：Tab 切换/表单/Modal 行为与原版一致，<br/>re-render 作用域收窄到单个 Tab
